    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「いや、もう『おはよう』って時間じゃないわよ。だいじょうぶ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんた、急にトイレで失神したって聞いたんだけど～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「どっか、痛いところとかない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「医者の不養生よね。何やってんのよ、まったくもう。……あんまり、心配させないでよねっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「えっと。梅ちゃんがいるということは、ここは保健室でしょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ううん。美術室よ、保健室はなぜかベッドが満杯でさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「曽根先輩とＢ組のアホどもが何かやらかしたらしくて、ベッドどころか床でまで寝てたわよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「『部活荒らし』をアップデートしたという、『部活癒やし』とやらをやってたらしいけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「聞いただけで頭が悪くなりそうだから、詳しいことは知らないわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あいつらも、何やってんだかね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ただまぁ、トイレに寝かせとくわけにもいかないから。あんたを、転校生がここまで運んでくれたのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ここ、仮眠用の組み立て式ベッドがあるみたいだったから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「そうですか……。すみません、お手数をおかけしました」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ずっと、わたくしの手を握っていてくれたのですね……梅ちゃん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「何よ、文句あんの？　ていうか、あんたが寝ながら急にあたしの手ぇ握ってきたんでしょうがよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「いつまで甘えん坊なのよ、文字通り手がかかるわねっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「いつもは、あんたが『そう』してくれたでしょ。今回はその逆よ、仕返しよっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「『仕返し』という表現は、あまり適切ではないと思います……。あふ、ふあぁふ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「大欠伸しないでよ、みっともない。あんた気ぃ抜きすぎよ、また寝ないでよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「ふふ。梅ちゃんがそばにいるなら、わたくしに恐れるものなどありません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まりあ",
    "text": "「今後も、わたくしをお導きくださいね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 18,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ど～かしらね。来年度も同じクラスになれるとは、限らないから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんたの世話ばっかり焼いてられなくなるかもよ、……だから今だけは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「このあたしが、特別に、手ぐらい握っててあげる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「他の連中には、してあげないんだから。幼なじみの腐れ縁だから、『仕方なく』なんだからねっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
