    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 42,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「気づくのが遅いわよ。それ、『新制服』だってさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「詳しい経緯は省くけど、美術室を仮眠室として利用させてもらう代わりにモデルをさせられてんのよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんた、トイレで気絶したからね。未使用のきれいなトイレだったとはいえ、不衛生かもしれないし……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「着替える必要もあったし、一石二鳥でしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あっ……。着替えさせたのはあたしだから、安心しなさいよねっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-new-boy",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-new-boy_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
